# Intentional design choices for non-production network test infrastructure.
# See specs/09-connectivity-test-plan.md for context.

# AWS-0028: EC2 IMDS does not require token — test instances, not hardened
AVD-AWS-0028

# AWS-0102: NACL rule allows all ports — required for ICMP connectivity tests across TGW
AVD-AWS-0102

# AWS-0104: SG unrestricted egress — required for test EC2s to reach remote cells
AVD-AWS-0104

# AWS-0107: SG unrestricted ingress — bastion must accept SSH/ICMP from the internet
AVD-AWS-0107
